DMEB Benchmark — License Terms
==============================

This release contains two kinds of material with distinct terms.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
1. DATASETS (Robot Modest DR, Robot Ultra DR, Synthetic CARLA, iPhone)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The datasets are licensed under the
Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial 4.0 International License (CC BY-NC 4.0).
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc/4.0/

You are free to share and adapt the datasets for non-commercial research,
provided you give appropriate credit (cite the paper; see CITATION.cff).

Subset-specific notes:
  - Synthetic (CARLA): rendered images and metadata are released under CC BY-NC 4.0.
    The CARLA simulator and its bundled assets remain under their own licenses
    (https://carla.org/) and are NOT redistributed here.
  - Robot / iPhone: captured in controlled settings. Any incidental personal data
    (faces, license plates) has been reviewed/removed where present; see
    dataset/known_issues.md for the exclusion log.
  - External datasets (e.g., Choi et al., CVPR'25) are NOT redistributed. Obtain
    them from the original authors under their own terms.

